<title>USA: Fruit of the Loom Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Fruit of the Loom Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			 21,200		   12,500</p>
<p> Revs		     501,000		  506,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  76,400		   76,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago sales include $16.0 million in hosiery sales. Hosiery operations were sold on Nov 8, 1996. Excluding hosiery, Q1 1997 sales were up 2.2 percent from a year ago.  </p>
<p>Q1 interest expense $18.9 million vs $27.2 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
